---
title: Project Structure
description: File and directory structure of each Lament repository.
section: Development
order: 1
---

## Frontend (`lament`)

```
lament/
├── src/
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── api.ts              # Client-side API utilities
│   │   ├── server/
│   │   │   └── api.ts          # Server-side proxy module
│   │   └── components/         # Svelte components
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── +layout.svelte      # Root layout
│   │   ├── +page.svelte        # Home page
│   │   ├── api/                # Server proxy endpoints
│   │   ├── artists/            # Artist pages
│   │   ├── albums/             # Album pages
│   │   └── ...
│   └── app.html
├── static/
├── svelte.config.js
├── vite.config.ts
└── package.json
```

## API (`lament-api`)

```
lament-api/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts                # App entry, middleware
│   ├── server.ts               # Dev server (Hono Node adapter)
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── index.ts            # Route registration
│   │   └── edge-routes.ts      # All edge route definitions
│   ├── controllers/            # Request handlers
│   ├── services/               # Business logic
│   ├── middlewares/             # Auth, cache middleware
│   ├── config/                 # Configuration
│   ├── utils/                  # Utilities
│   └── scripts/                # CLI scripts (migration, etc.)
├── schema.sql                  # Database schema
├── wrangler.jsonc              # Cloudflare Workers config
└── package.json
```

## Scraper (`lament-scrapper`)

```
lament-scrapper/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts                # Main scraper entry
│   ├── spotify.ts              # Spotify metadata fetcher
│   ├── downloader.ts           # YouTube audio downloader
│   ├── lyrics.ts               # Lyrics fetcher (Genius)
│   ├── lastfm.ts               # Last.fm metadata
│   ├── cloud.ts                # R2 upload logic
│   ├── db.ts                   # Database operations
│   ├── config.ts               # Configuration
│   ├── scripts/                # Utility scripts
│   └── services/               # Additional services
├── schema.sql
└── package.json
```
